{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"goblin","model_identifier":"goblin","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# goblin\n\nGoblin (C4), 1.2 m = 43 u (44 u to the scalp upright; hunched ~40 u in every clip).\n\nA wiry 1.2 m goblin, green-grey skin, hunched back and knobbly hump, an oversized head with huge swept ears, a hooked nose, a wide toothy mouth and glowing yellow eyes, long arms (hands at the knee), leather scraps. Carries a crude rusty dagger and a plank shield of three rope-lashed boards with an iron spike. Shared goblin rig: baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (slot_hand_r, slot_hand_l, slot_head on the scalp, slot_back between the shoulder blades).\n\n- Cubes: 30 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..44.0, z -7.5..6.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 42 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.42 | loop |  |\n| `flee` | 0.38 | loop | arms flung up, looking back over its shoulder, panicked run (loop) |\n| `taunt` | 1.6 | once | hops side to side, waggles its head and slaps its backside (1.6 s) |\n| `aggro` | 1 | once | hop and lunge (1.0 s) |\n| `injured` | 0.45 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.2 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `attack_stab` | 0.7 | once | key 0.3 s: lunging underarm stab (reach ~20 u) |\n| `attack_flurry` | 1.1 | once | keys 0.25, 0.5, 0.75 s: three quick jabs around the raised shield |\n| `climb` | 0.8 | loop | in-place scramble up a rock face at -Z (loop 0.8 s); move the root up the wall in game |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.30 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 32.4 u per cycle\n- `run`: 149.3 u/s (4.20 m/s), cycle 0.42 s, 62.7 u per cycle\n- `flee`: 164.3 u/s (4.62 m/s), cycle 0.38 s, 62.4 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_stab`: key 0.3 s: lunging underarm stab (reach ~20 u)\n- `attack_flurry`: keys 0.25, 0.5, 0.75 s: three quick jabs around the raised shield\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 44, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 31, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 31, 5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 27, -5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 18.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 21, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 21, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `dagger` (visible, under slot_hand_r): grip at the origin, blade along -Z (8.5 u)\n- `shield` (visible, under slot_hand_l): 12 x 15 u plank shield on the left forearm\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit cubes.\n- Variant textures: goblin_pale.png, goblin_moss.png (skin tone).\n"},"description":"# goblin\n\nGoblin (C4), 1.2 m = 43 u (44 u to the scalp upright; hunched ~40 u in every clip).\n\nA wiry 1.2 m goblin, green-grey skin, hunched back and knobbly hump, an oversized head with huge swept ears, a hooked nose, a wide toothy mouth and glowing yellow eyes, long arms (hands at the knee), leather scraps. Carries a crude rusty dagger and a plank shield of three rope-lashed boards with an iron spike. Shared goblin rig: baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (slot_hand_r, slot_hand_l, slot_head on the scalp, slot_back between the shoulder blades).\n\n- Cubes: 30 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -13.0..13.0, y 0.0..44.0, z -7.5..6.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 42 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 2 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 0.7 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.42 | loop |  |\n| `flee` | 0.38 | loop | arms flung up, looking back over its shoulder, panicked run (loop) |\n| `taunt` | 1.6 | once | hops side to side, waggles its head and slaps its backside (1.6 s) |\n| `aggro` | 1 | once | hop and lunge (1.0 s) |\n| `injured` | 0.45 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 1.2 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `attack_stab` | 0.7 | once | key 0.3 s: lunging underarm stab (reach ~20 u) |\n| `attack_flurry` | 1.1 | once | keys 0.25, 0.5, 0.75 s: three quick jabs around the raised shield |\n| `climb` | 0.8 | loop | in-place scramble up a rock face at -Z (loop 0.8 s); move the root up the wall in game |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.30 m/s), cycle 0.7 s, 32.4 u per cycle\n- `run`: 149.3 u/s (4.20 m/s), cycle 0.42 s, 62.7 u per cycle\n- `flee`: 164.3 u/s (4.62 m/s), cycle 0.38 s, 62.4 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_stab`: key 0.3 s: lunging underarm stab (reach ~20 u)\n- `attack_flurry`: keys 0.25, 0.5, 0.75 s: three quick jabs around the raised shield\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 44, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 31, 6)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 31, 5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 35.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 27, -5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 18.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 11, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 21, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 21, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `dagger` (visible, under slot_hand_r): grip at the origin, blade along -Z (8.5 u)\n- `shield` (visible, under slot_hand_l): 12 x 15 u plank shield on the left forearm\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l are the lit cubes.\n- Variant text